Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Source: https://winaero.com/change-the-number-of-items-in-jump-lists-in-windows-10/
; INI tweak: JumpListItems_Maximum=2
; Winaero's article notes that Windows 10 may not show fewer than 10 items.

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Explorer\Advanced]
"JumpListItems_Maximum"=dword:00000002
